  P4 -->|"tools: create/update/list/plan"| S2
  P5 -->|"tools: generate/list summary"| S3
  P6 -->|"seed + lifecycle state"| S4
  P7 -->|"hooks/tool usage/llm/compaction logs"| S5

  O3 -->|"surap_preference_memory_*"| P3
